Package: kylin-memory-bench
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KylinMemoryBench project contributors <unconfigured@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-yaml
Description: Evidence-based long-term memory benchmark for AI agents
 KylinMemoryBench evaluates long-term memory behavior through structured
 evidence, deterministic scoring and six capability dimensions. It includes a
 command-line interface, benchmark suites, agent configuration examples and
 offline JSON/Markdown/HTML/SVG reporting.
